        inf("S6.1c", "Every coefficient of such an ordinary product satisfies $|h_j|\\le r2^{2p}<2^{3p}<B_0/2$, so after the lower coefficients are removed the next coefficient is identified by its centered residue modulo $B_0$.",
            "|h_j|\\leq r2^{2p}<2^{3p}<B_0/2."),
        inf("S6.1d", "To form $A_u$ the carry recurrence $d_j\\equiv u_j+\\gamma_j\\pmod{B_0}$ keeps $\\gamma_j\\in\\{-1,0\\}$ because $-B_0<u_j+\\gamma_j<B_0$, giving a fixed-width two's-complement encoding with $\\gamma_r=-1$ exactly when $A_u<0$, in $O(rp)$ steps.",
            "Since $-B_0<u_j+\\gamma_j<B_0$ whenever $\\gamma_j\\in\\{-1,0\\}$, the carry stays in $\\{-1,0\\}$."),
